{"c":[{"id":"79ee0e2da00c6468","sum":"v1: .scratch/ never committed; Screenpipe sidecar behind a hard-failing last-N facade; Supabase control plane only; never commit SUPABASE_HACKATHON_TOKEN. CI keeps macos-26 (macos-15 type-checks #available). Caret.app runs own screenpipe@0.4.50 :3031; no CaretProjectRoot: no-op.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"fb9536a9c704d4b7","sum":"Repo and v1 lore: SumMem at .summem/summem; .scratch/ never committed; v1 kept five upstreams, Screenpipe a supervised sidecar (launcher lease) behind a last-N facade that hard-fails when down or empty; Supabase is control plane only; never commit SUPABASE_HACKATHON_TOKEN.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"5e2a432b193b2a33","sum":"Repo setup and v1 lore: SumMem at .summem/summem; .scratch/ never committed; v1 kept five upstreams with Screenpipe as a sidecar plus last-N facade.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"13a625ab21eb3fe9","sum":"SumMem 0.12.0 lives at .summem/summem (AGENTS.md Project Memory block is the write rule); .scratch/ is gitignored local scratch, never committed.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T170845Z-b7aad83361017857","text":"Onboarded SumMem 0.12.0 as .summem/summem (not a packages/ pin); AGENTS.md Project Memory block is the write rule.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T172705Z-bea3983b0d18183c","text":".scratch/ is gitignored local scratch (exports, dumps); do not commit it","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ab8c7585980a9874","sum":"v1 Caret keeps five upstreams (KeyType, GhostType, Computer Use Jev, Skyvern, Screenpipe); Screenpipe history is a sidecar plus last-N facade, never vendored, no TCC inherited from its CLI.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T173934Z-80f0ac884170d4c1","text":"Caret keeps five upstreams: KeyType, GhostType, Computer Use Jev, Skyvern and Screenpipe. docs/input-pipeline.md defines the proposed shared Jev/context/workflow handoff; the current action UI does not call the Python CLI.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T174647Z-c6a318f44bd68335","text":"Screenpipe history for Caret is sidecar plus facade (last N minutes/windows); do not vendor current engine or inherit TCC from their CLI","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"05674c45506c1bae","sum":"v1 Screenpipe and secrets: last-N inference hard-fails when the sidecar is down or empty; Caret supervises pinned Screenpipe via a launcher lease; Supabase is control plane only; never commit SUPABASE_HACKATHON_TOKEN.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"a7b8b39bcec29186","sum":"v1: inference needing Screenpipe last-N hard-fails when the sidecar is down or empty; CI has secret SUPABASE_HACKATHON_TOKEN, never commit its value.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T174733Z-8bbd21a4d3d18747","text":"Caret inference that needs Screenpipe history hard-fails if the sidecar is down or last-N is empty; do not continue on a miss","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T175112Z-813e2fb0e5f124b2","text":"GitHub Actions repo secret SUPABASE_HACKATHON_TOKEN is available for CI; do not commit the value.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"0988f580d7d5ff22","sum":"v1: Caret launches and supervises pinned Screenpipe (TCC stays on its binary; client uses the launcher lease); Supabase only as control plane, never for last-N or threads.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T175326Z-cc8628073d6c6682","text":"Override: Caret launches and supervises pinned Screenpipe; do not spawn revoked; TCC still on their binary; client uses launcher lease","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T175517Z-d3f766ae6d1e35f4","text":"Supabase earns a seat only as company control plane (identity, entitlements, kill-switch, structured facts); skill bodies stay git/Cursor plugins; never upload last-N or threads.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"43ee91e8384e1ba6","sum":"Mac CI: keep macos-26/Xcode 26 in ci.yml (macos-15 type-checks #available); #if-gate new SDK APIs. Caret.app runs its own screenpipe@0.4.50 on :3031, never attaching; clipboard needs --disable-clipboard-capture false; lease in .local/. No CaretProjectRoot key: supervisor no-ops.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"fec1309988e3870c","sum":"Mac CI runs macos-26 (Xcode 26, glassEffect): keep the Xcode 26 select in ci.yml, not macos-15 (Xcode 16.4, where #available still type-checks); #if compiler-gate new SDK APIs. Screenpipe 0.4.50 keeps no clipboard history unless --disable-clipboard-capture false.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"54b806582777cca4","sum":"2026-09-19 hackathon was happy-path only (ship, do not polish, preflight must not block on niceties). Mac CI: macos-15 defaults to Xcode 16.4 and #available still type-checks, so keep the Xcode 26 select in ci.yml and #if compiler-gate new SDK APIs.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T175827Z-8c1a94d022e0b4f9","text":"2026-09-19 hackathon: GSD and happy-path only; ship, do not polish; preflight must not block on niceties","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T180736Z-4ff972dc89772e30","text":"Mac CI (macos-15) defaults to Xcode 16.4; #available is runtime-only and still type-checks. Keep the Xcode 26 select in ci.yml and #if compiler-gate new SDK APIs.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"3a7837f8430ada51","sum":"Mac CI on main runs macos-26 for glassEffect/Xcode 26; do not move it back to macos-15 (Xcode 16.4). Screenpipe 0.4.50 keeps no clipboard history unless --disable-clipboard-capture false; Caret's pinned launch does not pass it.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T180843Z-c0da2dfb3d09eb5e","text":"Mac CI on main is macos-26 for glassEffect/Xcode 26. Do not move that job back to macos-15 default Xcode 16.4.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T181107Z-8c8e5b028a0a7d1d","text":"Screenpipe 0.4.50 stores no clipboard history by default; enable with --disable-clipboard-capture false. Caret pin launch does not pass that flag.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"82995c451c95a78f","sum":"Caret.app runs its own screenpipe@0.4.50 on :3031 (never attaches; a second recorder can stop the first); clipboard needs --disable-clipboard-capture false; last-N via .local/screenpipe-lease.json. No INFOPLIST_KEY_CaretProjectRoot: ScreenpipeSupervisor.start no-ops.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"aa7dada86df3ecf0","sum":"Caret last-N reads minutes/windows/clipboard, newest first, via a lease in .local/screenpipe-lease.json. Caret.app launches screenpipe@0.4.50 on :3031 with clipboard on; clipboard is a Screenpipe UiEventType input, off unless --disable-clipboard-capture false.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T181331Z-7829432da9c4fa32","text":"On main 3db8f16 Caret last-N is minutes/windows via a lease; Caret.app does not spawn Screenpipe. Clipboard is a Screenpipe input UiEventType, off unless --disable-clipboard-capture false.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T182537Z-ff4a55f19dd31fc9","text":"Caret.app launches screenpipe@0.4.50 on 3031 with clipboard on and writes .local/screenpipe-lease.json. history-windows/minutes/clipboard are newest-first.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"7effd9669f8097f6","sum":"Caret.app starts its own screenpipe@0.4.50 on :3031, never attaching to a manual or launchd one (a second recorder can stop the first). INFOPLIST_KEY_CaretProjectRoot is missing from generated Info.plist, so ScreenpipeSupervisor.start is a no-op until it is added.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T183142Z-62bc24835e4cc470","text":"Caret.app always starts its own screenpipe@0.4.50 on :3031 and does not attach to a manual or launchd instance; a second recorder can stop the first.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T183914Z-5f4c9ce43ef55285","text":"INFOPLIST_KEY_CaretProjectRoot does not land in GENERATE_INFOPLIST_FILE output, so shipped Caret.app has no project root and ScreenpipeSupervisor.start is a no-op until that key is actually in Info.plist.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4a30ad9bb039ceab","sum":"v1: skills JSON in caret/skills/<id>/; screenpipe@0.4.50 (:3031) has its own AX prompt, /search needs Bearer SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY + X-Screenpipe-Client: api; last-N hard-fails; xcodeproj IDs unique (Info.plist B100…62); make install needs packages/keytype.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"cf173c783d21b3d2","sum":"Caret skills: JSON under caret/skills/<action-id>/. Pinned screenpipe@0.4.50 (launchd dev.caret.hackathon.screenpipe, :3031, cli-darwin Mach-O holds TCC) has its own AX prompt, unaffected by Caret's grant. Inference last-N hard-fails. xcodeproj object IDs must be unique.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"d8373d741af56a81","sum":"Caret skills: name/description JSON under caret/skills/<action-id>/ (not Apify SKILL.md). Pinned screenpipe@0.4.50 has its own Developer ID and AX prompt; Caret's grant does not stop it. Debug menu shows truncated last-2 via history-debug; inference last-N hard-fails.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"25648c3d0b258189","sum":"Caret skills are name/description JSON under caret/skills/<action-id>/, not Apify's coding-agent SKILL.md; Apify is not a selected executor. Niko QA/Preflight (2026-09-19) used only cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh-fast or Gemini 3.8 Flash.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T185053Z-ae95c44f0be90de0","text":"Apify Agent Skills are coding-agent SKILL.md (MCP/CLI/Actors); Caret skills are name/description JSON under caret/skills/<action-id>/. Apify is not a selected Caret executor.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T185221Z-b9280ccda04db89b","text":"2026-09-19: Niko QA/Preflight in this repo today must use only cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh-fast or Gemini 3.8 Flash (Gemini not on the subagent allow-list).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"458043431cd4683f","sum":"Pinned screenpipe@0.4.50 has its own Developer ID (screenpipe) and its own AX prompt; granting Caret Accessibility does not stop it. Caret Debug menu shows truncated last-2 windows/minutes/clipboard via history-debug CLI; last-N hard-fail stays for inference.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T190218Z-3dcac55ddd67aa19","text":"Pinned screenpipe@0.4.50 is Developer ID identifier screenpipe, not Caret; it calls AXIsProcessTrustedWithOptions and retries while waiting. Granting Caret Accessibility does not stop its dialog.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T190435Z-bd82100fe9b9695e","text":"Caret Debug menu shows truncated last-2 windows/minutes/clipboard via history-debug CLI; last-N hard-fail stays for inference.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"1dc8d7a171a0b9ab","sum":"Caret runs screenpipe@0.4.50 as launchd job dev.caret.hackathon.screenpipe on :3031 via the cli-darwin Mach-O (TCC is that binary); its screen/AX preflights stayed false despite Settings. Caret.xcodeproj object IDs must be unique; a FileRef in a Sources list breaks xcodebuild.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"73ecfa7fb5d9e38e","sum":"Caret runs screenpipe@0.4.50 as launchd job dev.caret.hackathon.screenpipe on :3031, exec'ing the cli-darwin Mach-O (TCC is that binary), not the npx shim; it logged screen=false accessibility=false and System Settings ON did not flip those preflights.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T190651Z-7c7ff0f30e9d0baa","text":"Caret-spawned screenpipe@0.4.50 on :3031 at 14:03 logged screen=false accessibility=false and retried VisionManager every 5s; System Settings ON did not flip those preflights.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T191856Z-e383776735c95605","text":"Caret starts screenpipe@0.4.50 as launchd job dev.caret.hackathon.screenpipe on :3031; exec the cli-darwin Mach-O, not npx/node shim. TCC is that binary.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"23edfb00e1d611eb","sum":"After PR #11 (main merged), README/productContext/techContext keep launchd Screenpipe wording and the Debug last-2 preview. Caret.xcodeproj object IDs must be unique; a FileRef in a Sources files list stops xcodebuild opening the project.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T192245Z-7c3e6304f151c521","text":"PR #11 merged main; README/productContext/techContext keep launchd Screenpipe wording plus Debug last-2 preview.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T192513Z-736b08c59f95f4f1","text":"Caret.xcodeproj object IDs must be unique; a FileRef in a Sources files list makes xcodebuild unable to open the project","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"357d6a64e95bbcfa","sum":"v1: xcodeproj Info.plist B100…62 (57 TabCompletions); Screenpipe /search needs Bearer SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY + X-Screenpipe-Client: api; vercel key is a bare token file; make install needs packages/keytype; Translate reads selection or clipboard, not the caret line.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"eb97d3ea4b169abf","sum":"Caret.xcodeproj Info.plist is B100…62 (57 is TabCompletions); Screenpipe 0.4.50 /search needs Bearer SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY plus X-Screenpipe-Client: api; router tests advance a fake clock past the 10 s backoff.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"8b70e773b2fa893f","sum":"Caret.xcodeproj: Info.plist is B100…62, B100…57 is TabCompletions; never give Info.plist 57. Screenpipe 0.4.50 /search 403s without Bearer SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY (/health is open); Caret _api sent SCREENPIPE_API_KEY only if set.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T192920Z-0329343e8c4345de","text":"Current Caret.xcodeproj: Info.plist is B100…62; B100…57 is TabCompletions. Do not assign Info.plist 57.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T193615Z-bae439ab3f2c08e5","text":"Screenpipe 0.4.50 /search 403s without Bearer SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY; /health is open. Caret _api only sent SCREENPIPE_API_KEY if set.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"0394a3f3d78f5601","sum":"Router tests advance a fake clock past the 10 s failure backoff; Caret last-N sends Bearer plus X-Screenpipe-Client: api with the token from SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY, SCREENPIPE_API_KEY, or screenpipe's own.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T193745Z-b26ffd587de72a56","text":"Router backs off RouterConfig.failure_backoff_seconds (10s) after a failed evaluation; router tests advance a fake clock rather than expecting an immediate retry. Provider presets patch their own module's post_json in tests.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T193825Z-36390ce7b0d562a4","text":"Caret last-N sends Bearer plus X-Screenpipe-Client: api; token from SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY, SCREENPIPE_API_KEY, or pinned screenpipe auth token.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8267e3a9d1defc9a","sum":"v1 keys and skills: vercel-api-gateway-key is a bare token file; make install needs packages/keytype; Debug last-N skips Caret Debug, inference last_n_windows does not; Translate reads a selection or the clipboard, never the caret line.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"0077b084d2383d9f","sum":"Keys and builds: vercel-api-gateway-key is a bare token file (CoreLaunchSettings envFile holds AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY/GROQ_API_KEY as KEY=value); make install needs the packages/keytype checkout or xcodebuild resolve exits 74.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T214418Z-9e6967d283b5b427","text":"vercel-api-gateway-key is a bare token file (not KEY=value); CoreLaunchSettings envFile is the KV path for AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY / GROQ_API_KEY.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T214943Z-7cb27000d0b12580","text":"make install requires packages/keytype checkout (CompletionUI); empty submodule dir makes xcodebuild resolve fail with 74","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f8e28d7f83c0c10b","sum":"v1 gateway skills: Debug last-N skips the Caret Debug window, inference last_n_windows does not; Translate reads a live selection or the clipboard, never the caret line.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T215111Z-04557dfeed12d63f","text":"Debug last-N windows skip title Caret Debug (matches showDebugWindow); inference last_n_windows does not skip.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T215901Z-031ebbfd04136a32","text":"Translate uses a live non-empty selection or the clipboard; it never uses the caret line. Other gateway skills still do.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
